# Can we use UTF8 in regex?
Server init.
>> p := Icyitegererezo-cyishakisha gishya: ['\\w'].
Ibisohoka andika: ( p guhura: ['x'] ), umurongo-mushya.
Ibisohoka andika: ( p guhura: ['é'] ), umurongo-mushya.
>> p := Icyitegererezo-cyishakisha gishya: ['(*UTF)(*UCP)\\w'].
Ibisohoka andika: ( p guhura: ['é'] ), umurongo-mushya.
# should give 101